@orders = http://localhost:8113

### happy path (W3C baggage header)
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
baggage: customer-id=c-42

{"productId": "p1", "quantity": 2}

### slow downstream
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": "slow", "quantity": 1}

### downstream error
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": "broken", "quantity": 1}

### semantic-convention metric names
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/query?query=http_server_request_duration_seconds_count
